    <!-- Main Content Container -->
    <div class="utilikit uk-xw--800 uk-mg--auto">

      <!-- Chapter 1 -->
      <section class="utilikit uk-mg--b-32 uk-sm-mg--b-48">
        <h2 class="utilikit uk-fs--24 uk-sm-fs--28 uk-md-fs--32 uk-fw--700 uk-tc--1f2937 uk-mg--b-16 uk-ls--0">
          Chapter 1: The Rise of Component-Based Architecture
        </h2>

        <!-- Text with floated image -->
        <div class="utilikit uk-cl--both">
          <!-- Floated Image - Right -->
          <figure class="utilikit uk-fl--none uk-sm-fl--right uk-sm-wd--300 uk-md-wd--350 uk-mg--0 uk-sm-mg--l-24 uk-sm-mg--b-16">
            <div class="utilikit uk-bg--f3f4f6 uk-ar--16-9 uk-br--8 uk-dp--flex uk-ai--center uk-jc--center uk-tc--9ca3af">
              <span class="utilikit uk-fs--48">📊</span>
            </div>
            <figcaption class="utilikit uk-fs--12 uk-sm-fs--14 uk-tc--6b7280 uk-ta--center uk-mg--t-8">
              Figure 1: Component architecture diagram showing modular design patterns
            </figcaption>
          </figure>

          <p class="utilikit uk-fs--16 uk-sm-fs--18 uk-lh--28 uk-tc--374151 uk-mg--b-16">
            The shift towards component-based architecture has fundamentally changed how we approach web development. No longer are we building monolithic applications; instead, we're crafting modular, reusable pieces that can be combined in countless ways.
          </p>

          <p class="utilikit uk-fs--16 uk-sm-fs--18 uk-lh--28 uk-tc--374151 uk-mg--b-16">
            This approach brings numerous benefits: improved maintainability, better testing capabilities, and enhanced collaboration among team members. When each component is self-contained, developers can work on different parts of the application simultaneously without stepping on each other's toes.
          </p>

          <p class="utilikit uk-fs--16 uk-sm-fs--18 uk-lh--28 uk-tc--374151 uk-mg--b-16">
            Modern frameworks like React, Vue, and Angular have embraced this philosophy wholeheartedly, providing developers with powerful tools to create sophisticated user interfaces while maintaining clean, organized codebases.
          </p>
        </div>

